{
  "key": "ws-consentletter",
  "config": {
    "pageSize": "A4",
    "pageMargins": [40, 40, 40, 40],
    "watermark": {
      "text": "DELHI JAL BOARD",
      "color": "#004085",
      "opacity": 0.08,
      "bold": true,
      "italics": false
    },
    "defaultStyle": {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "color": "#333333",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "DELHI JAL BOARD",
        "style": "mainHeader"
      },
      {
        "text": "INFORMATION NOTICE - NEW CONNECTION & METER INSTALLATION",
        "style": "subHeader"
      },
      {
        "canvas": [{ "type": "line", "x1": 0, "y1": 5, "x2": 515, "y2": 5, "lineWidth": 1.5, "lineColor": "#004085" }]
      },
      {
        "text": "Subject: Information Regarding New Connection and Meter Installation",
        "style": "subjectStyle",
        "margin": [0, 15, 0, 8]
      },
      {
        "text": "Dear Consumer,",
        "bold": true,
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "text": "This is to inform you that your New Water Connection has been processed by Delhi Jal Board. The details of the new connection and the authorized/licensed plumber assigned for meter installation are provided below.",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 12]
      },
      {
        "text": "New Connection Details",
        "style": "sectionHeader"
      },
      {
        "table": {
          "widths": ["40%", "60%"],
          "body": [
            [{ "text": "Application / Connection No.:", "bold": true }, "{{applicationNo}}"],
            [{ "text": "Consumer Name:", "bold": true }, "{{consumerName}}"],
            [{ "text": "Address:", "bold": true }, "{{consumerAddress}}"],
            [{ "text": "Zone:", "bold": true }, "{{zone}}"],
            [{ "text": "ZRO Office:", "bold": true }, "{{zro}}"],
            [{ "text": "Connection Type:", "bold": true }, "{{connectionType}}"],
            [{ "text": "Connection Approval Date:", "bold": true }, "{{approvalDate}}"],
            [{ "text": "Meter Installation Timeline Date:", "bold": true }, "{{installationDate}}"]
          ]
        },
        "layout": "lightHorizontalLines",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "Licensed Plumber Details",
        "style": "sectionHeader"
      },
      {
        "text": "The consumer is requested to get the water meter installed through the following Delhi Jal Board licensed plumber:",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "table": {
          "widths": ["40%", "60%"],
          "body": [
            [{ "text": "Plumber Name:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberName}}"],
            [{ "text": "Plumber Company Name:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberCompany}}"],
            [{ "text": "Mobile Number:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberMobile}}"],
            [{ "text": "Licence / Registration No.:", "bold": true }, "{{plumberLicense}}"]
          ]
        },
        "layout": "lightHorizontalLines",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 6]
      },
      {
        "text": "The above-mentioned licensed plumber is authorized/assigned to carry out the meter installation for the new connection.",
        "italics": true,
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "Important Information for the Consumer",
        "style": "sectionHeader"
      },
      {
        "ol": [
          "Please coordinate with the above-mentioned licensed plumber for installation of the meter at the approved new connection premises.",
          "Please verify the name and identity of the licensed plumber before allowing the meter installation activity.",
          "The meter should be installed at the approved location as per Delhi Jal Board requirements.",
          "The consumer is requested to ensure that the meter number and initial meter reading are properly recorded after installation.",
          "The consumer should retain the meter installation details and relevant photographs/documents for future reference.",
          "In case of any discrepancy regarding the assigned plumber or meter installation, please contact the concerned ZRO / Delhi Jal Board office before proceeding with the installation."
        ],
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 15]
      },
      {
        "text": "For any clarification regarding the new connection or meter installation, the consumer may contact the concerned Delhi Jal Board office.",
        "margin": [0, 0, 0, 12]
      },
      {
        "text": "Regards,\nDelhi Jal Board",
        "bold": true
      }
    ],
    "styles": {
      "mainHeader": {
        "fontSize": 16,
        "bold": true,
        "alignment": "center",
        "color": "#004085"
      },
      "subHeader": {
        "fontSize": 11,
        "bold": true,
        "alignment": "center",
        "margin": [0, 3, 0, 6]
      },
      "subjectStyle": {
        "fontSize": 11,
        "bold": true,
        "color": "#111111"
      },
      "sectionHeader": {
        "fontSize": 11,
        "bold": true,
        "color": "#004085",
        "margin": [0, 6, 0, 6]
      }
    }
  }
}
